{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12401","headline":"奉送户部李郎中充晋国副节度出塞 · 钱起","name":"奉送户部李郎中充晋国副节度出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德佐调梅用，忠输击虏年。\n子房推庙略，汉主托兵权。\n受命荣中禁，分麾镇左贤。\n风生黑山道，星下紫微天。\n始愿文经国，俄看武定边。\n鬼方尧日远，幕府代云连。\n汗马将行矣，卢龙已肃然。\n关防驱使节，花月眷离筵。\n自忝知音遇，而今感义偏。\n泪闻横吹落，心逐去旌悬。\n帝念夔能政，时须说济川。\n劳还应即尔，朝暮玉墀前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}